th%27s_Candle_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth%27s_Candle\" title=\"Lolth's Candle\">Lolth's Candle</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1001px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1334px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Render by Konstantin Melnik</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.143 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.156 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5528/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89961/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18417/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1077/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\